From a4375768b2c08d41e4c5b606b19f2945ef3c7bae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daryl Denson <9751141+denson9874@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:49:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] AppErrorDialog: copy the crash log itself instead of
 uploading it

The crash dialog's Copy button uploaded the whole crash log to
paste.evolution-x.org, Evolution X's paste server, and copied the link.
ExpressiveOS is its own ROM and shouldn't send crash logs to another
project's server: put the log text (its first 100k chars) on the
clipboard and confirm with a toast. Drop the translations of the two
reworded strings so the new English text shows.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
